== Trivia ==
* Cain appeared in the original ''Binding of Isaac'', with the same unlock method.
* Cain is a reference to the Biblical story of Cain and Abel, in which Cain commits the first murder by killing Abel.
** {{i|Abel}} also appears as an item in ''Rebirth''.
** Cain's special interaction with Abel is also a reference to this.
* [[Co-op#Rebirth Babies|Glass Baby]] could be a reference to Cain having a glass eye.
* Cain's locked icon shows him bound in chains.
** He shares this trait with {{C|Magdalene}}, {{C|Samson}}, {{C|Eve}}, {{C|Lazarus}}, {{C|Bethany|r}}, and {{C|Jacob and Esau|r}}.
** He is the only character whose mouth is visible when locked.
* The fact that he takes 55 coins to unlock may be a reference to how it is said that Jesus cast out 55 demons during his life.
* Cain's Lucky Foot item is mistakenly called "Luck Foot" in the character selection screen.
** This is similar to Samson's {{i|Bloody Lust}} item, which is also missing its "y" and is called "Blood Lust" in his character description.

